# Chart Studio Edit Links Were Removed

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Migrate an old configuration

Plotly.js v4 removed the Chart Studio edit link and the configuration fields
`showLink`, `linkText`, `sendData`, `showEditInChartStudio`, and `showSources`.
Remove these options rather than renaming them. The old `mapboxAccessToken`
configuration is also removed; use the map trace examples with token-free tiles.

`showSendToCloud` still exists, but plotly_ex hides Upload to Cloud by default.
Notebook 12 shows explicit opt-in. For a local copy of figure data, use the
`downloadJson` example instead.
